This repository accompanies a manuscript under peer review, comparing six
models (LSTM, Bi-LSTM, GRU; BERT, DistilBERT, RoBERTa) on multi-label toxic
comment classification. It is shared so others can verify the results,
reuse the code, or build on this work.

Dataset notice: this repository does not redistribute the Jigsaw Toxic
Comment Classification Challenge dataset. See README.md for the Kaggle
source link.
